{"title": "Civil Militia", "pageid": 6570, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Civil_Militia", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Civil_Militia.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Civil_Militia.webp/300px-Civil_Militia.webp, /w/images/a/aa/Civil_Militia.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Civil_Militia.webp/300px-Civil_Militia.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Civil_Militia.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Civil Militia</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with spears, pikes, halberds, and glaives, as well as with light armour and shields.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">weapon proficiency</a> with:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spears\" title=\"Spears\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png/25px-Spears_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png/38px-Spears_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png/50px-Spears_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spears\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png/25px-Spears_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spears\" title=\"Spears\">Spears</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/25px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/38px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/50px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pikes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/25px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\">Pikes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halberds\" title=\"Halberds\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/25px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/38px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/50px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halberds\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/25px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halberds\" title=\"Halberds\">Halberds</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/25px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/38px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/50px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glaives\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/25px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\">Glaives</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_light_armour\" title=\"Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_light_armour\" title=\"Armour\">Light armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" title=\"Shields\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/38px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/50px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shields\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shields_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">Shields</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Half-Elf\" title=\"Half-Elf\">Half-Elf</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Jacelyn\" title=\"Jacelyn\">Jacelyn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Maddala_Deadeye\" title=\"Maddala Deadeye\">Maddala Deadeye</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Varanna_Sunblossom\" title=\"Varanna Sunblossom\">Varanna Sunblossom</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/Spears\" title=\"Spears\">spears</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\">pikes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Halberds\" title=\"Halberds\">halberds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\">glaives</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Light_armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light armour\">light armour</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">shields</a>.</div>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195715\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1512/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10180/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 